                        "entry_id": "c7749fc7-aa57-307d-9b05-97b3059c36fa",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Of a project, etc: very new and still evolving; yet to reach its full potential."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "593ce9d1-f697-4747-a65f-e68b7564f8b0",
                                "sense_id": "60eed90c-91bc-30e1-85cc-3168c01b0cea",
                                "text": "We are also to see the green-lighting of some much overdue reform of fares and ticketing, even if it's still embryonic and to be trialled on part or the network."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
